menu "P4 destructive SD format diagnostic"

    config SD_FORMAT_DIAG_DESTRUCTIVE_AUTHORIZED
        bool "Compile the explicitly authorized destructive SD formatter"
        default n
        help
            Enables destructive repartitioning and FAT32 formatting only for
            the reviewed Elecrow 10.1-inch J5 microSD path: SDMMC slot 0,
            one-bit at 1 MHz, GPIO43 CLK, GPIO44 CMD, GPIO39 D0. This erases
            the inserted card. D1-D7, card detect, write protect, and every
            unrelated GPIO/peripheral remain disabled.

endmenu
